  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n8x2 + 9x + 8 = 0\n\n**Calculations:**\n\n8x2 + 9x + 8 = 0\n\n⇒ 8x2 + 8 = - 9x\n\n⇒ 8x + 8/x = - 9\n\n⇒ 8(x + 1/x) = - 9\n\n⇒ (x + 1/x) = - 9/8\n\nNow,\n\n(x³ + 1/x³) = (x + 1/x)³ - 3 (x + 1/x)\n\n⇒ (x3 + 1/x3) = (-9/8)³ - 3 (-9/8)\n\n⇒ (x3 + 1/x3) = (-729/512) + 27/8\n\n⇒ (x3 + 1/x3) = (-729 + 1728)/512 = 999/512\n\n**∴ The value of the given equation will be (999)/(512).**",
